# Procedural Generation and Automatic Evaluation of Game Levels

## My interpretation of the brief

The project is about automatically creating game levels and evaluating them based on properties such as solvability, difficulty, and diversity.

## Why I am a good fit for this project

I am interested in games, programming, and algorithms. I like the idea of creating different game levels automatically.

## Relevant experience and background

I have basic programming knowledge from my Computer Science Engineering studies and I am interested in improving my programming skills.

## Proposed approach

I would create a simple level generator, check whether the generated levels can be completed, and compare different generation approaches.

## Initial plan

1. Define the level structure.
2. Build a basic generator.
3. Add level evaluation.
4. Add another generation approach.
5. Compare the results.

## Additional information

I plan to use Git from the beginning and develop the project step by step.
